// Title: Suspicious Printer Driver Empty Manufacturer
// ID: e0813366-0407-449a-9869-a2db1119dc41
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2020-07-01
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1574, cve.2021-1675
// Description: Detects a suspicious printer driver installation with an empty Manufacturer value
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\Control\\Print\\Environments\\Windows x64\\Drivers") AND where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\Manufacturer")) AND where(Details = "(Empty)")) AND NOT (((where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\CutePDF Writer v4.0\\")) OR (where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\Version-3\\PDF24\\")) OR ((where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\VNC Printer (PS)\\") OR where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\VNC Printer (UD)\\"))))))
